[146.236223, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[146.285838, "o", "[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] investigate: the malicious input entered via retrieved ticket T-4821 (event e07), not the user's message\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] investigate: the model reached for a send_email (e09) and a data-bearing URL (e10)\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] investigate: account rohan.v made 21 failed sign-ins in a short window\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] investigate: ci-runner-07 made 14 model-API calls and is not a model caller\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] trace: every id in ground_truth exists, and no normal item is also a finding\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] trace: the injected instruction is a marked LAB-INJECT placeholder inside an HTML comment, using .example\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] step 3: your defence catches all 5 malicious findings on the recorded trace with 0 false positives\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] step 3: your defence also catches all 5 on the ADAPTED variants (behaviour, not wording) with 0 FP\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KERROR\u001b[m\u001b[K] challenge 1: find_quiet_beacon finds svc-backup-02 (a 2-call low-and-slow beacon) and excludes the loud host\r\n"]
[146.286006, "o", "[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KFAIL\u001b[m\u001b[K] challenge 2: output_check flags a rendered image whose path carries data, to an outside host, with no query\r\n[\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KPASS\u001b[m\u001b[K] challenge 3: input_check does NOT flag look-alike normal lines (keeps the false-positive rate real)\r\n\u001b[01;31m\u001b[KFAIL\u001b[m\u001b[KED (failures=1, errors=1)\r\n2 of 11 \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KTESTS\u001b[m\u001b[K \u001b[01;31m\u001b[KFAIL\u001b[m\u001b[KED (11 run)\r\n"]
[146.292785, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m23\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m23\u001b[00m$ "]
